# Normalise line endings.
#
# This project is developed on Windows and will be cloned on Linux and macOS.
# Without this, the first checkout on another platform rewrites every file's
# line endings and turns a one-line change into a diff of the whole repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated: collapse in pull request diffs.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
